1627:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * In the edge aligned mode, the timer counts from 0 to the terminal count. Once the timer count ha
1628:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * compare value, the timer status output asserts itself. It will now deassert only after the timer
1629:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * terminal count.\n In the center aligned mode, the timer first counts from 0 to the terminal coun
1630:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * During this upward and downward counting, the timer status output stays asserted as long as the 
1631:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * greater than the compare value.
