1664:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * Programs the timer period, by writing CC8yPRS register.\n\n
1665:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * The frequency of counting/ PWM frequency is determined by this value. The period value is writte
1666:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * register. Explicitly enable the shadow transfer for the the period value by calling
1667:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * XMC_CCU8_EnableShadowTransfer() with appropriate mask. If shadow transfer is enabled and the tim
1668:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * a period match transfers the value from the shadow register to the actual period register.
1669:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  *
