1813:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * \par<b>Description:</b><br>
1814:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * Enables dithering of PWM frequency and duty cycle, by configuring CC8yTC.DITHE and CC8yDITS bits
1815:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * Some control loops are slow in updating PWM frequency and duty cycle. In such a case, a Bresenha
1816:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * can help reduce long term errors. Dithering can be applied to period and duty individually,
1817:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * this can be selected using the parameter \b period_dither and \b duty_dither.
1818:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * The \b spread would provide the dither compare value. If the dither counter value is less than t
1819:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * the period/compare values would be dithered according to the dither mode selected. This API woul
1820:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * XMC_CCU8_SLICE_SetDitherCompareValue().
1821:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  *
1822:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * \par<b>Note:</b><br>
1823:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * After this API call, XMC_CCU8_EnableShadowTransfer() has to be called with appropriate mask
1824:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * to transfer the dither value.
1825:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  *
1826:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu8.h ****  * \par<b>Related APIs:</b><br>
